{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-02-06 11:00:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS OPENS NEW OFFICES IN NEW YORK STATE AND ALBERTA, CANADA', 'text': 'LOCATIONS IN BUFFALO AND EDMONTON WILL FOCUS ON AN INCREASING PROJECT PORTFOLIO AND ACHIEVING COMPANY GROWTH PLANS \xa0 LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , FEB. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO BROADEN ITS\xa0AMERICAS PRESENCE BY ESTABLISHING TWO NEW PROJECT DELIVERY OFFICES IN EDMONTON, ALBERTA, CANADA AND BUFFALO, NEW YORK (NY).'}